  "goodToKnow": "Die Ausgrenzung is exclusion or marginalisation: soziale Ausgrenzung, Ausgrenzung von Minderheiten, Mobbing und Ausgrenzung in der Schule. Ausgrenzen means to exclude or ostracise. The opposite concepts are Inklusion (especially for people with disabilities, a big theme in German schools since 2009) and Integration. Die Grenze is a border or limit. Plural: die Ausgrenzungen."
